ranium black panther  and wakanda would go on to play a major  role in the mcu  but they also did this with captain  america and the incredible hulk they  teased the super soldier serum and then  eventually they would go on in captain  america the first avenger to inject  steve rogers with that serum making him  into captain america  and now we have two easter eggs two  unspoken  easter eggs for namor the location  pinpointed in iron man 2 and then the  avengers in-game underwater earthquake  easter egg  but now it's time for the more obvious  easter egg in the first captain america  film howard stark literally said the  word vibranium and that's where the  eternals come in  if we do see the sinking of atlantis  they will most likely refer to the city  as atlantis and this will most likely be  our first  true teaser for namor then in doctor  strange and the multiverse of  madness if they do form the illuminati  this will be the first true appearance  of namor  and then if everything comes together  like the reports say namor will finally  make his actual mcu debut  in black panther 2. so namor is coming  to the mcu the writers of avengers  in-game admitted that they did put that  name or easter egg in the film  and now it's only a matter of time until  we get an official tease  so let me know what you think about this  news and let me know how pumped you are  for namor to enter the mcu be sure to  let me know what you think about this  in the comments down below again don't  forget to subscribe to stay up to date  on all things relating to the mcu and  for live updates you can follow me on  twitter  as always thank you all so much for  watching woof

